#: processes/sdlc/merge-to-main.bpmn:37
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The merge steward while a Merge Manager is active; with none active, the PR's own session takes this lane (owner ruling 2026-10-06). Reads evidence, finds and records authorisation, merges and follows through. Never authorises: that is the owner's lane, and no reading of an instruction moves it here."
msgstr ""

#: processes/sdlc/merge-to-main.bpmn:155
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The owner's answer to the question Task_Ask asked. Their words are quoted verbatim in the record, so the answer is given in the conversation or on the PR, not inferred from tone."
msgstr ""

#: processes/sdlc/merge-to-main.bpmn:58
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The repository owner. The only lane that can say `merge`. Answers a question that carried the evidence; a person, never an agent, a sibling session or a bot."
msgstr ""

#: processes/sdlc/merge-to-main.bpmn:192
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Through `merge:guard <pr> --merge --session <id>` where the repository has it; elsewhere with the merge call pinned to the head SHA, so GitHub refuses if the head moved. Merge commit unless the repository or owner says otherwise. Never delete the branch."
msgstr ""

